MODULE: ConsumerBatchesRespondReceiverIgnoresThrottled
TARGET: ConsumerBatchesRespond
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the receiver ignores only the throttled batch response
PERTURBS: ReceiverShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = ReceiverBatch(LogicalValue(1))]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: retain full size only for a Throttled logical lookup.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.receiver = IF LogicalValue(1) = 1 THEN FullBatch ELSE ReceiverBatch(LogicalValue(1))]
--- END
